# A pattern is a shape, not a thesis. The engulfing bar says buyers
# absorbed the prior day's selling; three lower closes before it say
# there was selling worth absorbing. The context lives in the rule,
# stated explicitly, never baked silently into the tag — and the exit
# states its own pattern the same way.

strategy "Engulfing After Weakness"

universe [sp_top_30]
timeframe 1d

when [bullish_engulfing] and [down_days 3]
  buy [risk 1%]

sell when [evening_star]
  or [doji 8%]
  or [stop 6%]
  or [after 15 bars]
